  return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {
    realpath.realpath(filepath, cache, (err, resolved) => {
      if (err) reject(err)
      else resolve(resolved)
    })
  })
}
```

The ponyfill handles `cache` being a function (shifts to cb), but passing both cache object and cb is fine. Let me remove the weird branch.

